# Thermal Calculation - Melt Rate & Physics Engine
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1. Full thermal calculation - Project 1 (London, indoor cooled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/thermal/1/calculate

### 2. Full thermal calculation - Project 2 (Dubai, outdoor/heat stress)
GET {{baseUrl}}/thermal/2/calculate

### 3. Full thermal calculation - Project 3 (New York)
GET {{baseUrl}}/thermal/3/calculate

### 4. Manual temperature override - worst-case 38 C heat wave scenario
GET {{baseUrl}}/thermal/1/calculate/override?temperatureCelsius=38.0

### 5. Manual override - comfortable 12 C evening scenario
GET {{baseUrl}}/thermal/1/calculate/override?temperatureCelsius=12.0

### 6. Manual override - Dubai worst case 45 C
GET {{baseUrl}}/thermal/2/calculate/override?temperatureCelsius=45.0

### 7. Quick melt rate check (current conditions)
GET {{baseUrl}}/thermal/1/melt-rate

### 8. Melt rate for Dubai outdoor display
GET {{baseUrl}}/thermal/2/melt-rate

### 9. Error case - project not found
GET {{baseUrl}}/thermal/999/calculate

### 10. Error case - invalid temperature override (out-of-range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/thermal/1/calculate/override?temperatureCelsius=99.0